#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To disable metrics for a particular data source,\n"
"set `quarkus.datasource.jdbc.enable-metrics` to `false`, or apply `quarkus.datasource.<datasource name>.jdbc.enable-metrics` for a named datasource.\n"
